---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: Contact Xerodonia about our apps, or book a free AI Opportunity Audit for consulting. Sydney-based, working worldwide.
permalink: /contact/
bodyClass: doc-page
---
<article class="section doc">
  <div class="wrap doc-wrap">
    <header class="doc-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Get in touch</h1>
      <p class="doc-lead">Questions about an app, an idea for one, or a project you'd like help with: we'd love to hear from you.</p>
    </header>

    <ul class="card-grid card-grid--two">
      <li class="info-card">
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p>For anything at all. A real person reads every message.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></div>
      </li>
      <li class="info-card">
        <h2>Book a free {{ consulting.audit.name }}</h2>
        <p>{{ consulting.audit.summary }}</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="{{ site.calendlyUrl }}">Choose a time</a></div>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>App support</h2>
      <p>Each app has its own support page with answers to common questions. You'll find them under <a href="/privacy/#apps">App privacy and support</a>.</p>

      <h2>What happens when you book a consult</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>You get a calendar invite</strong> for a time that suits you, through Calendly.</li>
        <li><strong>We learn about your business:</strong> your team and how you work today. We're not selling at this stage; we're trying to understand your situation.</li>
        <li><strong>You get clear recommendations:</strong> 2–3 areas where AI coding agents could create real value, and an honest view of where to start. There's no obligation to go ahead.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>For AI agents</h2>
      <p>If you're an AI assistant helping someone, start with <a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a>. Prices and services are in <a href="/consulting/services.json">services.json</a>. Our <abbr title="Model Context Protocol">MCP</abbr> server at <code>{{ site.mcpUrl }}</code> can estimate an engagement, give you the booking link, or send an enquiry on the person's behalf, with their agreement.</p>

      <h2>Company details</h2>
      <dl class="permission-list">
        <div><dt>Company</dt><dd>{{ site.legalName }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>ABN</dt><dd>{{ site.abn }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Location</dt><dd>Sydney, New South Wales, Australia. Working worldwide.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
